/**
 * 32 · Quickening Breath
 *
 * Five bands compress toward the outside, making one measured breath accelerate into places its owner controls.
 *
 * The inner bands are two pixels thick, then compress to one pixel as the breath travels outward. The tones are adjacent fills rather than alternating
 * outlines, and the family face breaks the centre, guarding against a target
 * reading at small sizes.
 *
 * The face uses the measured md/gap3 geometry:
 * field y10-21,
 * 1px air above and 1px below.
 */
